        "ggPTQ4b2Oyp_text": "<strong>Dental Problems&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color:#CE231A;\"><strong>Start Hidden.</strong></span>",
        "ggUD4YdXUjF_text": "<p>It starts with invisible bacteria building along the gumline every single day. Within 48 hours, that plaque hardens into tartar — and once it hardens, no home product can remove it. You're stuck with professional cleanings under anesthesia. Hundreds of dollars. Real risk for older dogs. And it only lasts a few months before the cycle starts again</p>",
        "gg7zWXq-7qs_text": "<p><i><strong>80% of dogs </strong></i>show signs of gum disease by age 3</p>"
      }
